"{\"url\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/project/prj_1K9W3ZCY71S0NRMS\",\"title\":\"Drobonso Carbon — Isometric\",\"head\":[\"UNDER VALIDATION\",\"BICRS\",\"Drobonso Carbon\",\"Nordic Carbon Partners\",\"->\",\"PROJECT DETAILS\",\"Expected first certificates\",\"2026\",\"Project code\",\"FZ80\",\"Crediting period\",\"01 May 2026 to 01 May 2042\"],\"issued_header\":null,\"buffer_header\":null,\"crediting\":null,\"verifier\":null,\"code\":\"FZ80\",\"approval\":\"Expected 2026\",\"protocol_current\":\"Biochar Production and Storage v1.3\",\"protocol_baseline\":null,\"cert_issued\":null,\"cert_retired\":null,\"cert_buffer\":null,\"reversal\":null,\"showing\":[\"Showing 2 of 2\"],\"tables\":[{\"heads\":[\"Submission date\",\"Title\",\"Download\"],\"rows\":[[\"11 May 2026\",\"Public Comment Summary\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"08 Apr 2026\",\"PDD\",\"PDF | ->\"]]}],\"links\":[{\"h\":\"https://nordiccarbon.dk\",\"t\":\"Nordic Carbon Partners\"},{\"h\":\"/protocol/biochar/1.3\",\"t\":\"Biochar Production and Storage v1.3\"},{\"h\":\"/supplier/spl_1JVPR1JK41S0DQ8S\",\"t\":\"Learn more\"},{\"h\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/standard#validation-and-verification-requirements\",\"t\":\"Isometric Standard\"},{\"h\":\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KOmLuhU6yzCYYtUWPyQCw4aByEEJ7Q1-/view\",\"t\":\"VVB Policy\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JVPR1JK41S0DQ8S/prj_1K9W3ZCY71S0NRMS/pjd_1KRB75B751S0Q8DC/public_comment_summary.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1JVPR1JK41S0DQ8S/prj_1K9W3ZCY71S0NRMS/pjd_1KNP655VT1S06QSQ/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"}],\"text\":\"UNDER VALIDATION\\nBICRS\\nDrobonso Carbon\\nNordic Carbon Partners\\n->\\nPROJECT DETAILS\\nExpected first certificates\\n2026\\nProject code\\nFZ80\\nCrediting period\\n01 May 2026 to 01 May 2042\\nPROTOCOL DETAILS\\nCurrent protocol version\\nBiochar Production and Storage v1.3\\nSummary\\n\\nDrobonso produces biochar from FSC 100% certified wood residues.\\n\\nHow carbon is being removed\\n\\nBiomass Carbon Removal and Storage (BiCRS) involves storing the carbon contained in waste biomass—organic material from living or recently living organisms. BiCRS works by halting or slowing the decomposition of biomass, enabling the carbon it contains to be stored long-term. This can be achieved by converting biomass into materials that decompose more slowly—such as biochar or bio-oil—or by storing it in environments where decomposition is slowed. For BiCRS to count as carbon removal, the biomass must be replenished to ensure additional carbon dioxide is drawn from the atmosphere.\\n\\nLearn more\\nProject timeline\\nCompleted 2025\\nInitial documentation submission\\nCompleted 17 Apr 2026\\nPublic comment period\\nExpected 2026\\nIN PROGRESS\\nAudit kick-off\\n\\nA Validation & Verification Body (VVB) officially commences the project validation and verification process. All VVBs are approved and appointed by Isometric based on the requirements outlined in the Isometric Standard and VVB Policy.\\n\\nExpected 2026\\nSite visit\\nExpected 2026\\nApproval date\\nExpected 2026\\nInitial credit issuance\\nProject documentation\\nSubmission date\\tTitle\\tDownload\\n11 May 2026\\tPublic Comment Summary\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n08 Apr 2026\\tPDD\\tPDF\\n->\\nShowing 2 of 2\\nPrevious\\nNext\"}"